      en: ["The fortress covers approximately 10 hectares.", "The rammed-earth walls reach up to 15 meters in height.", "British forces fortified the site in the 1840s during the First Anglo-Afghan War.", "Archaeological excavations have revealed coins from the Kushan period (1st-3rd centuries CE).", "The fortress is located at an elevation of 350 meters above sea level.", "The name 'Qala-i-Zal' first appears in 14th-century historical records."],
